# Temporary agent render/screenshot proofs — scratch only, never versioned.
# Default scratch dir for throwaway proofs is .agent/scratch/. Verify with
# `git check-ignore <path>` before writing proof anywhere new.
# Throwaway root proofs (e.g. probe.png). Legit art lives under public/,
# so root-only images are never versioned.
/*.png
/*.jpg
.agent/scratch/
